Audience comment mining method
title end

paragraph start
Read the comments under about ten posts of larger accounts in the subject. Copy each comment that states a problem, a goal or a question, with the post, the date and the exact words. Stop at fifty useful comments, then count and group them.
paragraph end

paragraph start
Public comments only, and no names are kept.
paragraph end

